        "explanation": "Senator Kennedy introduces a 'Medicare for All' bill and gives a long speech on the healthcare crisis. Because the bill is a new proposal and has not passed, this represents position-taking."
      },
      {
        "document_id": "1177",
        "explanation": "Senators Pryor and Chambliss write letters calling on the Air Force to reimburse subcontractors. Since this is an ongoing dispute with no secured resolution, it represents active advocacy, not credit-claiming."
      }
    ]
  }
}
